<title>UK: TT Group up after Kleinwort recommendation.</title>
<headline>TT Group up after Kleinwort recommendation.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in TT Group Plc firmed on Monday after strategists at Dresdner Kleinwort Benson included the company in their list of recommended stocks for 1997, dealers said.</p>
<p>TT shares were up 2-1/2p at 341 by 1205 GMT in volume of 196,260 shares.</p>
<p>Dealers said Kleinwort strategists were recommending ten stocks for 1997 but would release only two each day this week. They also recommended Johnson Matthey Plc, up 8-1/2p at 561-1/2 by 1205 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
